        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="features-grid">

        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                     fill="none"
                     stroke="currentColor"
                     stroke-width="1.5">
                    <path d="M5 8h14M5 8a2 2 0 110-4h14a2 2 0 110 4M5 8v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V8m-9 4h4" />
                </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="feature-text">
                <h3>Envío rápido</h3>
